    QOL_ABOUT_FISHING = "One key to fish and reel in (Key Bindings > Clara Combo Points), the pole equipped from the bags, and fishing mode (the bobber's splash heard over the rest) in the portrait's menu, the Fishing card and Clara's page. While the Easy Fishing addon is enabled, it runs instead: it is never turned off.",
    QOL_NAV_UNITSCAN = "UnitScan",
    QOL_ABOUT_UNITSCAN = "An alert (sound, red screen edges, a window to target it) as soon as a rare of WoW Forever, a name you added or your hunted mob is around; UnitScan Hardcore players' sightings are heard too. Its page: Esc > Options > AddOns > Clara Combo Points > Quests and progress > UnitScan, or /cl scan.",
    QOL_ABOUT_TULLARANGE = "Colors the icons of your action buttons (and the pet bar's) while their action is out of range, lacks mana or cannot be used: red at 75 % opacity out of range, the game's grey when unusable; out of mana is off by default. Each has its color, opacity and desaturation in Esc > Options > AddOns > tullaRange, and a box to turn it off (the game's own look then).",
