    EC_HOLD         = "Time an instant spell stays",
    QOL_NAV_REVERSEENGINEERING = "Reverse Engineering",
    QOL_ABOUT_REVERSEENGINEERING = "In the professions window (the game's and ClassicUI's), under a recipe's reagents: the reagents a profession makes, each with its own reagents and icons (what the bags hold lit, a chest on what the bank or another of your characters holds), or the list of raw materials as the addon Reverse Engineering shows it. The search finds a recipe by one of its reagents too; \"Name\" in quotes: that recipe alone. The filter menu shows only the recipes whose reagents you have. Its page: Esc > Options > AddOns > Clara > Economy and professions > Reverse Engineering.",
