    CRAFT_SW_SEARCH = "Search by reagent, \"Name\" for that recipe alone",
    CRAFT_HINT      = "Under the reagents of the recipe picked in the professions window (the game's and ClassicUI's). The bags, the bank and the mailbox of each of your characters are read when each is open, and what you mail to one of them counts on it until it opens its mail: a chest's tooltip says who has what.",
